082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535567 17592186045443 true] [17592186517471 1083 #uuid "e93d6931-7713-5b15-908e-6692f578076c" 13194139535567 17592186045443 true] [17592186517472 1068 #edb/ref 17592186517473 13194139535567 17592186045443 true] [17592186517472 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139535567 17592186045443 true] [17592186517472 1071 "What is the product of solutions of the equation $13{x}^{2}\\cdot {2}^{-x-4}+2x\\cdot {2}^{-x-4}-20\\cdot {2}^{-x-4}=4{x}^{2}\\cdot {2}^{-x-4}+5x\\cdot {2}^{-x-4}?$" 13194139535567 17592186045443 true] [17592186517472 1072 #uuid "f48c65d0-2285-5cf5-998e-b08d76dc5881" 13194139535567 17592186045443 true] [17592186517472 1074 "First, we factor the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}13{x}^{2}\\cdot {2}^{-x-4}+2x\\cdot {2}^{-x-4}-20\\cdot {2}^{-x-4} & =4{x}^{2}\\cdot {2}^{-x-4}+5x\\cdot {2}^{-x-4} \\\\ 13{x}^{2}\\cdot {2}^{-x-4}+2x\\cdot {2}^{-x-4}-20\\cdot {2}^{-x-4}-4{x}^{2}\\cdot {2}^{-x-4}-5x\\cdot {2}^{-x-4} & =0 \\\\ 9{x}^{2}\\cdot {2}^{-x-4}-3x\\cdot {2}^{-x-4}-20\\cdot {2}^{-x-4} & =0 \\\\ (9{x}^{2}-3x-20)\\cdot {2}^{-x-4} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now apply the zero product property, which states that $ab=0$ if and only if $a=0$ or $b=0.$ This gives us two equations,\n\n$$\n9{x}^{2}-3x-20=0\\,\\text{and}\\,{2}^{-x-4}=0.\n$$\n\nWe now solve each of these equations separately.\n\n- The equation $9{x}^{2}-3x-20=0$ can be factored as\n\n$$\n(3x-5)(3x+4)=0,\n$$\n\nwhich leads to the solutions $x=-\\frac{4}{3},\\frac{5}{3}.$\n\n- The equation ${2}^{-x-4}=0$ has no solutions because ${2}^{-x-4}$ is positive for every real number $x.$\n\nTherefore, the original equation has the solutions $x=-\\frac{4}{3},\\frac{5}{3},$ and their product is $(-\\frac{4}{3})\\cdot \\frac{5}{3}=-\\frac{20}{9}.$" 13194139535567 17592186045443 true] [17592186517473 1075 #edb/ref 17592186517446 13194139535567 17592186045443 true] [17592186517473 1075 #edb/ref 17592186517456 13194139535567 17592186045443 true] [17592186517473 1075 #edb/ref 17592